Comment: Installed by CMake as /usr/share/doc/onesimus/copyright of the .deb.
 The third-party components of the package (OpenSSL, statically linked; the
 Feather icons) and of its dependencies (Qt, QtGrpc) are described in
 /usr/share/doc/onesimus/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, their licence texts are in
 /usr/share/doc/onesimus/LICENSES/. Which files are AGPL-3.0-only (they follow
 the Bareos source) is listed in LICENSING.md of the source code.
 The complete corresponding source (Onesimus with OpenSSL) is attached to the
 GitHub release of this version as onesimus-<version>-src.tar.xz.

